131-## Configuration and Tools
132-
133:### How does automatic mode detection work?
134-
135-The action intelligently detects whether to run in interactive mode or automation mode:
136-
137-- **With `prompt` input**: Runs in automation mode - executes immediately without waiting for @claude mentions
138:- **Without `prompt` input**: Runs in interactive mode - waits for @claude mentions in comments
139-
140-This automatic detection eliminates the need to manually configure modes.
141-
142-Example:
143-
144-```yaml
145-# Automation mode - runs automatically
146-prompt: "Review this PR for security vulnerabilities"
147-# Interactive mode - waits for @claude mention
148-# (no prompt provided)

